WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.400
I don't recognize this charge. What now?

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:12.100
Slowly, yes. Nice and calm. I'm here.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.600
Savia finds the facts. You stay in control.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:22.600
A purchase at Nébula Market: 4,280.75 MXN, October 2.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:28.600
An existing demo request is kept. No second request is created.

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:31.900
And if it needs more than one expert?

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:35.400
Savia brings a team.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.120
So, who is looking at it?

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:43.650
Two helpers. One checks the facts. One finds a useful next step.

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:45.140
And you?

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:46.870
Breakfast.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.000
The customer confirmed the explanation helped. Savia kept the suggestions.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Compare the date and amount with your receipts.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Keep the reference with your receipts. A saved request is not a bank decision.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.900
And some things still need a human.

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:06.407
Like paddling.

00:01:06.407 --> 00:01:10.357
The inquiry was closed; the explanation helped you.

00:01:11.977 --> 00:01:13.757
They work on the question.

00:01:13.957 --> 00:01:15.957
So I don't have to chase everyone?

00:01:15.957 --> 00:01:17.057
Exactly.

00:01:17.357 --> 00:01:19.717
Do you have to start over tomorrow?

00:01:19.847 --> 00:01:25.647
No. Savia keeps the question, and brings back the next step.

00:01:29.357 --> 00:01:30.997
And tomorrow?

00:01:31.127 --> 00:01:33.167
Savia keeps the question.

00:01:44.357 --> 00:01:51.357
To find the charge, please tell me its date and amount.

00:01:51.357 --> 00:01:52.677
Can you keep up?

00:01:52.807 --> 00:01:54.367
Savia can.

00:01:54.497 --> 00:01:57.377
Good. I cannot.

00:01:57.657 --> 00:01:59.217
How does that work?

00:01:59.347 --> 00:02:05.387
One friendly voice. Two helpers. Permission before a bank action.

00:02:05.857 --> 00:02:07.937
So, what is next?

00:02:08.067 --> 00:02:11.827
Coffee first. Savia can keep the question.
